        "content": "## 🎯 Intent Routing\n\nSends the detected intent to the right handler — booking, lead capture, document, ticket, escalation or FAQ — then merges the results."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "754bf23b-0b5f-4e66-a292-be218b6138d0",
